<BRK/>
<OLI>Compressor driver,[ electric motor][ gas-engine]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Compressor driver connection</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Water cooler (evaporator)</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Water-cooled condenser</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>Heat recovery condenser coil</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI>Receiver</OLI><BRK/>
